/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 574 0 R
/E (The development of the AeroEye system is driven by four primary technical gaps and structural bottlenecks that currently exist in the field of low-cost autonomous Unmanned Aerial Vehicles \(UAVs\). While industrial-grade drones utilize multi-thousand-dollar sensor suites to achieve autonomy, the democratized drone market lacks a cohesive architecture that balances AI intelligence with flight stability. The specific problems addressed by this research are as follows: )
/Pg 14 0 R
/K [2]
>>
endobj
