/T (AeroEye is specifically engineered to overcome these four hurdles by utilizing a multi-threaded Python Ground Control Station \(GCS\), an ultra-fast UDP telemetry stream, and a dual-core ESP32 firmware architecture that segregates communication tasks from motor actuation. By solving these gaps, the project aims to demonstrate that professional-grade autonomy can be achieved through optimized software-hardware synergy rather than expensive, heavy onboard hardware. )
/E (AeroEye is specifically engineered to overcome these four hurdles by utilizing a multi-threaded Python Ground Control Station \(GCS\), an ultra-fast UDP telemetry stream, and a dual-core ESP32 firmware architecture that segregates communication tasks from motor actuation. By solving these gaps, the project aims to demonstrate that professional-grade autonomy can be achieved through optimized software-hardware synergy rather than expensive, heavy onboard hardware. )
/Pg 16 0 R
/K [1]
>>
