/E (Civilian-grade GPS carries a horizontal error margin of 3 to 5 meters. For close-range tracking, this margin is catastrophic, as it can lead to collisions or the drone completely losing the target. Furthermore, GPS provides no "semantic understanding"; a GPS-guided drone cannot distinguish a target from a stationary obstacle like a tree or a wall. )
/Pg 19 0 R
/K [4]
