759 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 579 0 R
/E (Most hobbyist-grade flight controllers \(based on F4 or F7 chips\) are designed for flight stabilization logic, not image processing. They lack the RAM and GPU power to run neural networks. Consequently, existing low-cost tracking often falls back on "color-blob" detection, which fails instantly if the lighting changes, a shadow falls, or the target wears a different color. )
/Pg 19 0 R
/K [5]
>>
endobj
