<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 579 0 R
/E (Many existing DIY links between a laptop and a drone use TCP \(Transmission Control Protocol\). Because TCP prioritizes data integrity, it will "pause" the data stream to re- request a lost packet. For a flying robot, a packet of data that arrives 100ms late is useless and causes the motors to "stutter," making smooth autonomous pursuit impossible. )
/Pg 19 0 R
/K [6]
>>
endobj
