793 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 581 0 R
/E (Protocol \(UDP\) for telemetry. By bypassing the "handshaking" delays of traditional Wi- Fi protocols, the system achieves near-instantaneous command transmission. Furthermore, the proposed system introduces a Dual-Core Execution Strategy on the ESP32. One core is locked to a high-speed watchdog timer that monitors connection health, while the second core handles the high-resolution 16-bit PWM signals required to drive the 2200KV motors with precision. )
/Pg 21 0 R
/K [6]
>>
endobj
