803 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 582 0 R
/E (Safety is a paramount advantage of the proposed system. Most DIY drones will "fly away" or crash if the control signal is lost. The AeroEye proposed system features a Software Watchdog that monitors the heartbeat of the connection every 500 milliseconds. If the connection drops, the ESP32 firmware takes over immediately, initiating a controlled landing sequence. Additionally, the system provides real-time Current Estimation and telemetry feedback to the GCS, allowing the operator to monitor the health of the brushless motors and battery voltage in real-time. )
/Pg 22 0 R
/K [5]
>>
endobj
