/P 582 0 R
/E (Because the system relies on visual data rather than satellite coordinates, it can operate with centimeter-level precision in environments where GPS is unavailable or unreliable \(such as under tree canopies or near tall buildings\). The use of the smartphone's IMU data to compensate for drone tilt further enhances this precision, making the system a superior choice for close-proximity autonomous operations. )
/Pg 22 0 R
/K [7]
>>
