/E (Open Source Software Stack: The project leverages a 100% open-source software stack, including Python 3.10, OpenCV, PyTorch, and the Arduino IDE. This eliminates recurring licensing fees and provides a sustainable development path where the community can contribute to the codebase without financial barriers. )
/Pg 24 0 R
/K [4]
>>
