829 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 584 0 R
/E (Scalable Hardware Components: The bill of materials \(BOM\) focuses on high-availability, low-cost components. The F450/Q450 frame, 30A Electronic Speed Controllers \(ESCs\), and the ESP32 are commodity items. Because these parts are standardized, maintenance and replacement costs are minimal. A total hardware failure in a commercial drone could cost thousands; in the AeroEye system, the most expensive flying component \(the ESP32\) costs less than $10. )
/Pg 24 0 R
/K [5]
>>
endobj
