/P 587 0 R
/E (This module acts as the "Eyes" of the system and resides on the Ground Control Station. It is responsible for ingesting the high-definition MJPEG stream from the smartphone via the IP Webcam protocol. Once a frame is received, it is fed into the YOLOv8 \(You Only Look Once\) inference engine. The engine identifies the target, calculates a bounding box, and extracts crucial spatial data: the horizontal center $\(x\)$, the vertical center $\(y\)$, and the height of the box. This module also handles the "Target Locking" logic, ensuring that the drone remains focused on a specific identified object even if other people or objects enter the background. )
/Pg 27 0 R
/K [7]
>>
endobj
