/T (The F450 frame was specifically selected due to its integrated Power Distribution Board \(PDB\). By having the positive and negative terminals etched directly into the bottom frame plate, the need for a bulky external wiring harness is eliminated. This significantly reduces the overall weight and lowers the center of gravity, which is critical for the stability of the vision-based tracking system. )
/E (The F450 frame was specifically selected due to its integrated Power Distribution Board \(PDB\). By having the positive and negative terminals etched directly into the bottom frame plate, the need for a bulky external wiring harness is eliminated. This significantly reduces the overall weight and lowers the center of gravity, which is critical for the stability of the vision-based tracking system. )
/Pg 33 0 R
/K [4]
>>
