/E (Input Design is the foundational process of defining how the system captures, sanitizes, and prepares data from both the physical environment and the human operator. In the AeroEye ecosystem, "Input" is a multi-dimensional stream of information that must be handled with extreme precision to prevent "garbage-in, garbage-out" scenarios, which in a drone system, could lead to a catastrophic crash. )
/Pg 40 0 R
