1020 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 600 0 R
/E (The design philosophy of AeroEye centers on modular decoupling. By meticulously designing the boundaries between the vision processing, the mathematical control logic, and the hardware actuation, we ensure that the system remains resilient to the heavy computational load of real-time AI. The design must account for the strict timing requirements of the UDP telemetry pipeline while simultaneously providing a rich, informative interface for the human operator. Through this rigorous design process, we create a blueprint that ensures the ESP32, the GCS, and the Smartphone operate as a single, deterministic machine capable of professional-grade autonomous behavior. )
/Pg 40 0 R
/K [4]
>>
endobj
1021 0 obj
<<
