/P 600 0 R
/E (System Design represents the core architectural phase of the development lifecycle, serving as the definitive technical bridge between the high-level requirements identified during the analysis stage and the actual physical implementation of the AeroEye platform. This phase is not merely about planning; it is about engineering a multi-layered communication and control framework that can survive the unpredictable dynamics of aerial flight. In this stage, the conceptual "distributed brain" is transformed into a concrete set of data structures, interface layouts, and algorithmic flows. )
/Pg 40 0 R
/K [5]
>>
