/P 607 0 R
/T (Heartbeat & Failsafe Logic: A critical safety component is the "Active Heartbeat" output. The system is designed to send a continuous stream of packets. If the output stream is interrupted, the drone's internal logic defaults to a "neutral" state, initiating a controlled landing sequence to prevent "Fly-Away" scenarios. )
/E (Heartbeat & Failsafe Logic: A critical safety component is the "Active Heartbeat" output. The system is designed to send a continuous stream of packets. If the output stream is interrupted, the drone's internal logic defaults to a "neutral" state, initiating a controlled landing sequence to prevent "Fly-Away" scenarios. )
/Pg 47 0 R
/K [4]
>>
