/E (GCS Graphical Layout:The visual output follows a structured spatial arrangement within the CustomTkinter window to maximize readability. The Primary Vision Canvas occupies the center of the UI, displaying the live MJPEG stream with an overlaid YOLOv8 Bounding Box and a central "Target Lock" crosshair. This is supported by the Sidebar Telemetry, a vertical panel on the right providing real-time text updates of X and Y error offsets and the current PID output values, while the System Console is bottom-aligned to log successful packet transmissions and connection acknowledgments \(ACK\) from the ESP32. )
/Pg 48 0 R
/K [2]
>>
endobj
