/Type /StructElem
/S /H1
/P 666 0 R
/T (Target Re-Identification \(Re-ID\) and Occlusion Recovery In real-world scenarios, targets are often temporarily hidden behind obstacles. Future versions will implement DeepSORT \(Simple Online and Realtime Tracking\) or similar Re-ID algorithms. This would allow the system to maintain a unique "feature fingerprint" of the target \(based on color, shape, and motion vectors\). If the subject is temporarily obscured by a tree or a building, the drone would not lose its lock; instead, it would use a predictive velocity model to anticipate the target's trajectory and re-acquire the specific individual once they reappear, preventing the system from accidentally switching to a different person in the frame. )
/E (Target Re-Identification \(Re-ID\) and Occlusion Recovery In real-world scenarios, targets are often temporarily hidden behind obstacles. Future versions will implement DeepSORT \(Simple Online and Realtime Tracking\) or similar Re-ID algorithms. This would allow the system to maintain a unique "feature fingerprint" of the target \(based on color, shape, and motion vectors\). If the subject is temporarily obscured by a tree or a building, the drone would not lose its lock; instead, it would use a predictive velocity model to anticipate the target's trajectory and re-acquire the specific individual once they reappear, preventing the system from accidentally switching to a different person in the frame. )
/Pg 106 0 R
/K [0]
>>
endobj
