1950 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H1
/P 666 0 R
/T (Transition to On-Board Edge Computing \(Jetson Nano Integration\) Currently, the system relies on a remote PC for vision processing, which introduces a dependency on a local Wi- Fi network and a specific communication radius. Transitioning the vision processing to an on-board module, such as an NVIDIA Jetson Nano or Orin Nano, would eliminate the latency inherent in Wi-Fi-based MJPEG streaming. By performing "Inference at the Edge," the drone could achieve sub-10ms response times. This would allow the AeroEye system to track targets moving at high velocities while operating in remote or "denied" locations where no external computing infrastructure or local area networks are available. )
/E (Transition to On-Board Edge Computing \(Jetson Nano Integration\) Currently, the system relies on a remote PC for vision processing, which introduces a dependency on a local Wi- Fi network and a specific communication radius. Transitioning the vision processing to an on-board module, such as an NVIDIA Jetson Nano or Orin Nano, would eliminate the latency inherent in Wi-Fi-based MJPEG streaming. By performing "Inference at the Edge," the drone could achieve sub-10ms response times. This would allow the AeroEye system to track targets moving at high velocities while operating in remote or "denied" locations where no external computing infrastructure or local area networks are available. )
/Pg 106 0 R
/K [3]
>>
