1959 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H1
/P 667 0 R
/T (GPS-Aided Navigation and Global Return-to-Home \(RTH\) Incorporating a U-Blox M8N GPS module would enable a failsafe "Return-to-Home" feature. In the event of a total loss of the vision link or a complete breakdown of the GCS radio signal, the drone would utilize satellite coordinates to autonomously navigate back to its original takeoff point. This adds a crucial layer of redundancy for long-range missions where visual contact might be intermittently lost due to terrain or signal interference. )
/E (GPS-Aided Navigation and Global Return-to-Home \(RTH\) Incorporating a U-Blox M8N GPS module would enable a failsafe "Return-to-Home" feature. In the event of a total loss of the vision link or a complete breakdown of the GCS radio signal, the drone would utilize satellite coordinates to autonomously navigate back to its original takeoff point. This adds a crucial layer of redundancy for long-range missions where visual contact might be intermittently lost due to terrain or signal interference. )
/Pg 107 0 R
/K [2]
>>
