3982 0 obj
<<
/Title (human detection would make the platform versatile for industrial, agricultural, and environmental use. By training the YOLOv8 model on custom datasets, the AeroEye system could be adapted for agricultural monitoring \(tracking specific livestock\), traffic analysis \(identifying vehicle types\), or search and rescue operations in disaster zones. This scalability proves that the underlying architecture is not just a person-tracker, but a general- purpose autonomous vision platform.)
/Dest [107 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 7 0 R
/Prev 4244 0 R
/Next 3437 0 R
>>
endobj
