/Title (GPS-Aided Navigation and Global Return-to-Home \(RTH\) Incorporating a U-Blox M8N GPS module would enable a failsafe "Return-to-Home" feature. In the event of a total loss of the vision link or a complete breakdown of the GCS radio signal, the drone would utilize satellite coordinates to autonomously navigate back to its original takeoff point. This adds a crucial layer of redundancy for long-range missions where visual contact might be intermittently lost due to terrain or signal interference.)
/Dest [107 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 7 0 R
/Prev 4252 0 R
/Next 4244 0 R
>>
endobj
