/Title (sensors around the airframe. By creating a "Virtual Bumper" or a local occupancy map, the drone could detect obstacles in its path and execute lateral evasive maneuvers automatically without breaking its primary visual lock on the target. This would move the project closer to the level of "Level 4 Autonomy" in drone technology.)
