/Title (The primary innovation of the proposed system is the decoupling of the "Eyes," the "Brain," and the "Muscles." In this setup, the smartphone serves as the "Eyes," capturing high-definition video and real-time IMU data. This data is not processed onboard, which would lead to heat and weight issues; instead, it is streamed to the GCS. The GCS acts as the "Brain," running a multi-threaded Python environment that processes the YOLOv8 object detection model. The "Muscles" are represented by the ESP32-WROOM microcontroller, which is dedicated solely to executing motor-mixing algorithms and maintaining stability based on the commands received from the GCS.)
/Dest [20 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 7 0 R
/Prev 4278 0 R
/Next 4282 0 R
>>
endobj
